WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.920
Keep support, connection and service fit separate.

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.660
Match the actual voltage and thermal envelopes, preserve the intended bonding functions,

3
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.100
and verify access with the rack populated.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.560
A passed check narrows uncertainty; it doesn't waive the remaining checks.

